    "comments": [
      {
        "id": "comment-1",
        "text": "BOOLEAN LOGIC\n\nAnd, Or, Not and Xor combine booleans. And is true only when both inputs are true; Or when either is;\nXor when exactly one is; Not flips a value. Select picks one of two values by a condition,\nthe data-flow version of an if/else (use Branch when you need to run different nodes instead).",
        "position": [
          60.0,
          -300.0
        ],
        "size": [
          900.0,
          170.0
        ],
        "color": [
          0.2,
          0.4,
          0.8,
          0.3
        ],
        "contained_node_ids": []
      },
      {
        "id": "comment-2",
        "text": "Expected: true AND false = false; true OR false = true; true XOR true = false; NOT false = true. Select Number with condition true returns the first value (10); Select String with condition false returns the second (\"no\").",
        "position": [
          60.0,
          -70.0
        ],
        "size": [
          1260.0,
          100.0
        ],
        "color": [
          0.2,
